  "title": "Filial Bonds",
  "description": "Wulf Wild-Blood asks the player to find his missing brother Torkild, who disappeared years ago and may have become a werebear. The player must locate Torkild wandering Solstheim, defeat him after he transforms, and return to Wulf with the sad news and a letter.",
